&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌤️ Want to skip the setup? Use our &lt;b&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://cloud.browser-use.com&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;cloud&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt; for faster, scalable, stealth-enabled browser automation!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;-llm-quickstart&#34;&gt;🤖 LLM Quickstart
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct your favorite coding agent (Cursor, Claude Code, etc) to &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.browser-use.com/llms-full.txt&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Agents.md&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prompt away!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;-human-quickstart&#34;&gt;👋 Human Quickstart
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Create environment and install Browser-Use with &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.astral.sh/uv/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;uv&lt;/a&gt; (Python&amp;gt;=3.11):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;uv init &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; uv add browser-use &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; uv sync
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# uvx browser-use install  # Run if you don&amp;#39;t have Chromium installed&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. [Optional] Get your API key from &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://cloud.browser-use.com/new-api-key&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Browser Use Cloud&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-fallback&#34; data-lang=&#34;fallback&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;# .env
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;BROWSER_USE_API_KEY=your-key
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;# GOOGLE_API_KEY=your-key
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-key
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Run your first agent:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;10
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;11
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;12
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;13
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;14
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;15
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;16
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;17
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;18
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;19
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;20
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;21
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-python&#34; data-lang=&#34;python&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kn&#34;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nn&#34;&gt;browser_use&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;kn&#34;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;Agent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;Browser&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;ChatBrowserUse&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# from browser_use import ChatGoogle  # ChatGoogle(model=&amp;#39;gemini-3-flash-preview&amp;#39;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# from browser_use import ChatAnthropic  # ChatAnthropic(model=&amp;#39;claude-sonnet-4-6&amp;#39;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kn&#34;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nn&#34;&gt;asyncio&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;async&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nf&#34;&gt;main&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;():&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;browser&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;Browser&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;        &lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# use_cloud=True,  # Use a stealth browser on Browser Use Cloud&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;agent&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;Agent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;        &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;task&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Find the number of stars of the browser-use repo&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;        &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;llm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;ChatBrowserUse&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(),&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;        &lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# llm=ChatGoogle(model=&amp;#39;gemini-3-flash-preview&amp;#39;),&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;        &lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# llm=ChatAnthropic(model=&amp;#39;claude-sonnet-4-6&amp;#39;),&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;        &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;browser&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;browser&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;agent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;run&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;vm&#34;&gt;__name__&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;==&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;__main__&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;asyncio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;run&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;main&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;())&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Check out the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.browser-use.com/open-source/introduction&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;library docs&lt;/a&gt; and the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.cloud.browser-use.com&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;cloud docs&lt;/a&gt; for more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;open-source-vs-cloud&#34;&gt;Open Source vs Cloud
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;picture&gt;
  &lt;source media=&#34;(prefers-color-scheme: light)&#34; srcset=&#34;static/accuracy_by_model_light.png&#34;&gt;
  &lt;source media=&#34;(prefers-color-scheme: dark)&#34; srcset=&#34;static/accuracy_by_model_dark.png&#34;&gt;
  &lt;img alt=&#34;BU Bench V1 - LLM Success Rates&#34; src=&#34;static/accuracy_by_model_light.png&#34; width=&#34;100%&#34;&gt;
&lt;/picture&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We benchmark Browser Use across 100 real-world browser tasks. Full benchmark is open source: &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/browser-use/benchmark&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;browser-use/benchmark&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use Open Source&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You need &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.browser-use.com/customize/tools/basics&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;custom tools&lt;/a&gt; or deep code-level integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to self-host and deploy browser agents on your own machines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://cloud.browser-use.com&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Cloud&lt;/a&gt; (recommended)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Much better agent for complex tasks (see plot above)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Easiest way to start and scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Best stealth with proxy rotation and captcha solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1000+ integrations (Gmail, Slack, Notion, and more)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Persistent filesystem and memory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use Both&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use the open-source library with your &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.browser-use.com/customize/tools/basics&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;custom tools&lt;/a&gt; while running our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.browser-use.com/open-source/customize/browser/remote&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;cloud browsers&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.browser-use.com/open-source/supported-models&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;ChatBrowserUse model&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;demos&#34;&gt;Demos
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;-form-filling&#34;&gt;📋 Form-Filling
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4 id=&#34;task--fill-in-this-job-application-with-my-resume-and-information&#34;&gt;Task = &amp;ldquo;Fill in this job application with my resume and information.&amp;rdquo;
&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/57865ee6-6004-49d5-b2c2-6dff39ec2ba9&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Job Application Demo&#34;
	
	
&gt;
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/browser-use/browser-use/blob/main/examples/use-cases/apply_to_job.py&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
